INSERT INTO [dbo].[Manga] ([Id],[Name],[Description],[Level],[Status],[Type],[Countries],[Season],[MangaSeasonId],[UserId],[CreateDate],[IdUserCreate]) VALUES (N'8efe16e7-5826-49c5-8150-cd24f6256512',N'GTO',N'22-year-old Eikichi Onizuka: pervert, former gang member... and teacher? Great Teacher Onizuka follows the incredible, though often ridiculous, antics of the titular teacher as he attempts to outwit and win over the cunning Class 3-4 that is determined to have him removed from the school. However, other obstacles present themselves throughout—including the frustrated, balding vice principal, Hiroshi Uchiyamada; old enemies from his biker days; and his own idiotic teaching methods. But Eikichi fights it all whilst trying to help his students, romance fellow teacher Azusa Fuyutsuki, and earn his self-proclaimed title. Also contains the gaiden "GTO: Great Toroko Oppai♡" (Tomoko''s Big Adventures).',1,3,2,112,1,N'e9c3f87d-e652-4fbb-b002-805d3775a3d4',NULL,'2026-03-04 17:00:00.000',N'00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001');
